TITLE:: SympathyPanel
summary:: Sympathy's window below the header: the device frame, with a chord menu that knows the chord
categories:: Libraries>Sympathy
related:: Classes/Sympathy, Classes/SympathyView, Classes/FxDevicePanel, Classes/FxDeviceGUI

DESCRIPTION::
link::Classes/FxDevicePanel::, as every effect of the family has it, with two things more: the chord menu in the tuning card says which of code::Sympathy.chordNames:: the six voices make now (or "own"), and the display (a link::Classes/SympathyView::) is told the panel, so the knobs of whatever is under the pointer light up.

code::Sympathy.panelClass:: answers it, so code::gui:: and code::panel:: build it, and so does anything that shows an FxParamUnit by its panel class.

code::
y = Sympathy.new;
w = Window("sympathy", Rect(100, 100, 1000, 560)).front;
p = y.panel(w.view);
w.view.layout = VLayout(p.view);
p.page = 1;     // character
p.focus = 2;    // the string card shows the third voice
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
